1
00:00:45,916 --> 00:00:47,708
准备好了吗

2
00:00:47,708 --> 00:00:48,833
纳努克！

3
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:52,500
我为你带来毁灭了！

4
00:01:09,833 --> 00:01:13,000
愤怒 源自苦弱 邪恶生物挣脱枷锁\nI feel the pain and anger, wicked monster, losin' control

5
00:01:13,125 --> 00:01:16,291
步入 硝烟战火 阴影苏醒金血入魄\nI'm ready for a battle, wakened shadow, blood on my soul

6
00:01:16,416 --> 00:01:17,875
烧吧 烧尽神国\nBurn it, burning it all

7
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,583
乐园 已陨落\nHeavens, let them fall

8
00:01:22,791 --> 00:01:26,000
痛饮 死灰苦涩 糟粕四散崩溃沉没\nThey taste of bitter ashes, littered plastic, crumblin' away

9
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,291
掠过 面孔零落 恶兽驰骋争向神堕\nThey glimpse the broken faces, devil racin', searching for faith

10
00:01:29,375 --> 00:01:30,875
撕破 撕裂所有\nCrushing, crushing it all

11
00:01:30,875 --> 00:01:34,291
黑夜 也跪我\nShadows, watch them crawl

12
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:39,166
癫狂染意念\nCreepin' up my brain

13
00:01:39,166 --> 00:01:44,875
苦痛中蔓延\nLearnin' from my pain

14
00:01:46,166 --> 00:01:49,666
白夜 烈日燎燃 看孤身 爆发耀斑\nBaby watchin' it burn, send death to isolation

15
00:01:49,666 --> 00:01:52,958
厄焰狂乱 看骄阳 无畏崩坍\nOh watchin' it burn, ain't got no hesitation

16
00:01:53,583 --> 00:01:56,125
越是粉碎（我）越要俯瞰\nWatchin' it burn, we're fallin' higher

17
00:01:59,666 --> 00:02:02,666
爆发耀斑\nWatchin' it burn!

18
00:02:02,666 --> 00:02:05,250
无畏崩坍\nOh watchin' it burn!

19
00:02:06,041 --> 00:02:08,833
越是粉碎\nWatchin' it burn!

20
00:02:09,416 --> 00:02:12,708
越 要 俯 瞰\nWatchin' it burn!

21
00:02:26,916 --> 00:02:30,750
琉璃成飞灰 偏要刺破黑夜\nLike glass that shattered, reaching through the darkness

22
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:34,541
呼声牵动残焰 自由渴念不歇\nVoices trailing fires, echo of desires

23
00:02:34,541 --> 00:02:38,375
沉默这世界 末日狂欢不灭\nA world of silence, sound of Death's parading

24
00:02:38,375 --> 00:02:44,958
直到往日旧念 为我阖眼\nPhantoms in the shadow, softly waiting...

25
00:02:47,541 --> 00:02:50,833
撕碎 金血怒绽 拥抱我 爆裂璀璨\nI'm tearin' it down! Embrace the detonation

26
00:02:50,833 --> 00:02:54,125
三千万转 响彻这 罪业回环\nBurnin' it loud! Cravin' our damn creation

27
00:02:54,708 --> 00:02:57,375
锁链挣断（我）向你之畔\nBreakin' the chain! I'm reachin' for ya

28
00:03:00,916 --> 00:03:03,833
咆哮 直至终焉 此身为 救世烈焰\nShout till the end! This blaze is my salvation!

29
00:03:03,833 --> 00:03:07,166
侵晨作剑 再创世 无毁信念\nSword in the wind! I strike without damnation!

30
00:03:07,791 --> 00:03:09,458
破晓星天\nShatter the skies!

31
00:03:09,458 --> 00:03:10,666
轮回\nNo fate

32
00:03:10,666 --> 00:03:11,791
命运\nNo king

33
00:03:11,791 --> 00:03:13,916
乌有\nNo god!

34
00:03:13,916 --> 00:03:16,375
向我俯首\nFall to my name!

35
00:03:17,041 --> 00:03:19,500
向我俯首\nFall to my name!

36
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:22,958
向我俯首\nFall to my name!

37
00:03:23,666 --> 00:03:30,833
向 我 俯 首\nFall to my name!

38
00:04:15,041 --> 00:04:16,125
我的愿望？

39
00:04:18,041 --> 00:04:19,125
我的愿望

40
00:04:19,125 --> 00:04:20,833
就是实现大家的愿望

41
00:04:25,166 --> 00:04:27,333
如果不能实现…

42
00:04:28,625 --> 00:04:31,125
就把它们 送往明天

